<title>UK: Canadian Wheat Board sets 1.0 billion Czk bond.</title>
<headline>Canadian Wheat Board sets 1.0 billion Czk bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Wood Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANADIAN WHEAT BOARD</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.75 PCT MATURITY    24.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.88    PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING   LUXEMBOURG PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 25</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25 PCT  SELL CONC  0.75 PCT  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    CANADA/MANITOBA</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZECH/CANADA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
